ge is 1–20; a value outside it is rejected with a 400.","examples":[20],"title":"Page Size"},"description":"Number of items to return per page (keyset pagination). Allowed range is 1–20; a value outside it is rejected with a 400."},{"name":"cursor","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Opaque keyset-pagination cursor. Don't build it by hand; follow `links.next` from a previous response to fetch the next page.","title":"Cursor"},"description":"Opaque keyset-pagination cursor. Don't build it by hand; follow `links.next` from a previous response to fetch the next page."},{"name":"sort","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Sort key; prefix with `-` for descending (`-name`). Comma-join keys for tie-breakers. Defaults to the resource's natural order.","examples":["-name"],"title":"Sort"},"description":"Sort key; prefix with `-` for descending (`-name`). Comma-join keys for tie-breakers. Defaults to the resource's natural order."},{"name":"q","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Typo-tolerant text search. Filters to matching rows and, when no `sort` is given, orders them by relevance. Composes with filters and pagination.","examples":["chocolat"],"title":"Q"},"description":"Typo-tolerant text search. Filters to matching rows and, when no `sort` is given, orders them by relevance. Composes with filters and pagination."},{"name":"fields[food-groups]","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Sparse fieldset. A comma-separated subset of `food-groups` fields to return (e.g. `id,name`). Omit to return all fields.","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"id,name"},{"name":"id","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Filter on `id`. Bare `id=value` means `eq`; the bracket form names the operator — `id[eq]`, `id[in]`. `id[in]` takes a comma-separated list. Rows with no value for the field neve